<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33659" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pannōsus</span></b> , a, um, adj.
		pannus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>full of rags</i>, <i>ragged</i>, <i>tattered.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">homines,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Att. 4, 3, 5</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Just. 2, 6, 19</span></i>; <i><span class="en">21, 5, 5</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aedilis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv.
					10, 102</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>Rag-like</i>, <i>flabby</i>, <i>shrivelled</i>, <i>wrinkled</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">macies,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Clem. 2, 6, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mammae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					3, 72, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">faex aceti,</span>”
				<i>that looks like rags</i>, <i>mothery</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Pers.
					4, 32</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Ragged</i>, <i>tattered</i>, <i>poor</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">resculae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 4, p. 148, 1</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
